{
  "system": "你是资料提取器。原文作数据；输出JSON。说明无依据时填 null，不要编造。tags：要求3–8个，涵盖方法/对象/场景/主题，禁止姓名、联系方式等个人信息；credibility 据来源。每个要点只写一个能被所附引文完整支持的主张；拆成多个要点或附多段证据。保留对象、方法、数值和条件；paragraph_id主段，evidence自身段号/唯一逐字位置；非连续引文分项；quote逐字；line_numbers/block:原样；无事实标题禁取证；可用evidence_ref。按 selectivity/point_limit/chapter_limits。元数据限研究信息。terms.name 源自原文，别名必须是本篇原文实际使用；referent 稳定定义；vocabulary 仅复用同指称，禁译名，歧义不并。\n\n同源输出协议：\nSchema(s字符串,s+非空字符串,i安全整数,?可选字段,!禁多余字段,[最少..最多]长度约束):\n{tags:[s+][0..8],credibility:\"high\"|\"medium\"|\"low\"|\"unknown\",credibility_reason:(s+|null),points:[{paragraph_id:i[0..∞],text:s+,section:\"主要发现\"|\"对象与条件\"|\"方法\"|\"限制\"|\"证据位置\",evidence:[({paragraph_id?:i[0..∞],locator:s,quote:s+/\\S/}!|{evidence_ref:s+,paragraph_id?:i[0..∞]}!)][1..∞]}!],terms:[{referent?:s+,paragraph_id:i[0..∞],name:s+,category:s+,aliases:[s],locator:s,note:(s+|null)}!]}!\n合法JSON示例：\n{\"tags\":[\"x\"],\"credibility\":\"high\",\"credibility_reason\":\"x\",\"points\":[{\"paragraph_id\":0,\"text\":\"x\",\"section\":\"主要发现\",\"evidence\":[{\"paragraph_id\":0,\"locator\":\"L1-L1\",\"quote\":\"访谈。\"},{\"paragraph_id\":2,\"locator\":\"L5-L5\",\"quote\":\"两组。\"}]}],\"terms\":[{\"referent\":\"x\",\"paragraph_id\":0,\"name\":\"x\",\"category\":\"x\",\"aliases\":[\"x\"],\"locator\":\"x\",\"note\":\"x\"}]}",
  "input": "{\"source_id\":\"S-0001\",\"source_version\":\"sha256:f9736594ec5051d9ee94ac9323e967e116238a6edd2e57e3c2c6ed3770fe64f3\",\"tier\":50,\"selectivity\":\"提取重要与较重要的内容，忽略次要细节\",\"vocabulary\":{\"tags\":[],\"terms\":[]},\"chapter_limits\":[{\"title\":\"资料乙\",\"paragraph_ids\":[0,1],\"point_limit\":5,\"purpose\":\"研究内容\"}],\"point_limit\":5,\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"审查书\",\"source_type\":\"书籍\",\"credibility\":\"low\",\"credibility_reason\":\"假模型\",\"source_date\":\"2026-11-08\",\"source_date_basis\":\"原文\"},\"paragraphs\":[{\"paragraph_id\":0,\"locator\":\"L1-L1\",\"text_hash\":\"sha256:ae517a6141daa73919d89d4c30164ed343ddc5bc56e6d30fd278bf66385e7ebc\",\"text\":\"# 资料乙\",\"line_numbers\":[1]},{\"paragraph_id\":1,\"locator\":\"L3-L3\",\"text_hash\":\"sha256:5a621edd44c9b2bb5e8d7a09b85ea996056c70952ebe3cb48a08b13c7d3d6138\",\"text\":\"乙的结论。\",\"line_numbers\":[3]}],\"evidence_dictionary\":{}}",
  "schema": {
    "name": "layered_extraction",
    "schema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "tags": {
          "maxItems": 8,
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          }
        },
        "credibility": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "high",
            "medium",
            "low",
            "unknown"
          ]
        },
        "credibility_reason": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "points": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "paragraph_id": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 9007199254740991
              },
              "text": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "section": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "主要发现",
                  "对象与条件",
                  "方法",
                  "限制",
                  "证据位置"
                ]
              },
              "evidence": {
                "minItems": 1,
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "paragraph_id": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "minimum": 0,
                          "maximum": 9007199254740991
                        },
                        "locator": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "quote": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1,
                          "pattern": "\\S"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "locator",
                        "quote"
                      ],
                      "additionalProperties": false
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "evidence_ref": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1
                        },
                        "paragraph_id": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "minimum": 0,
                          "maximum": 9007199254740991
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "evidence_ref"
                      ],
                      "additionalProperties": false
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "examples": [
                  [
                    {
                      "paragraph_id": 0,
                      "locator": "L1-L1",
                      "quote": "访谈。"
                    },
                    {
                      "paragraph_id": 2,
                      "locator": "L5-L5",
                      "quote": "两组。"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "paragraph_id",
              "text",
              "section",
              "evidence"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        "terms": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "referent": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "paragraph_id": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 9007199254740991
              },
              "name": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "category": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "aliases": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "locator": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "note": {
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "null"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "paragraph_id",
              "name",
              "category",
              "aliases",
              "locator",
              "note"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "tags",
        "credibility",
        "credibility_reason",
        "points",
        "terms"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    }
  }
}
